“When divine love filled me, I could no longer stand; I was overwhelmed and melted in tears, not madness.”
(Source: https://www.newadvent.org/fathers/110109.htm
)

“The Spirit may move the body, but never without the mind being sober.”
(Source: https://www.newadvent.org/fathers/0322.htm
)

“The Spirit’s gifts bring edification, not confusion; His fire brings clarity, not chaos.”
(Source: https://www.newadvent.org/fathers/200187.htm
)
